---
import Base from "@/layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Privacy policy"
  description="CarComparisonAI privacy policy: what we collect, what we don't, and your choices."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4">
    <section class="py-12">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">Privacy policy</h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-ink-faint">Last updated: June 2026</p>
    </section>
    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">What we don't collect</h2>
      <p class="leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
        CarComparisonAI has no user accounts. Your cost-of-ownership profile (mileage, fuel
        prices, ownership period) and your saved garage are stored only in your browser's local
        storage. They never leave your device and we cannot see them. Clearing your browser data
        removes them.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Analytics</h2>
      <p class="leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
        We use Vercel Analytics to understand aggregate traffic: which pages are visited and from
        which country. It is cookie-free and does not track individual visitors across sites. We
        do not use advertising trackers and we do not sell or share any data with third parties.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Hosting</h2>
      <p class="leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
        The site is hosted on Vercel, which processes standard server logs (such as IP addresses)
        to deliver the site securely. See Vercel's privacy policy for details on their
        processing.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section class="mb-10">
      <h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Questions</h2>
      <p class="leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
        Email{" "}
        <a
          href="mailto:info@carcomparisonai.com"
          class="text-brand underline hover:text-brand-dark"
        >
          info@carcomparisonai.com
        </a>{" "}
        with any privacy questions. If this policy changes, we will update the date above.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
